      children: [(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.strong, {
        children: "Osho Darshan:"
      }), " The definition of the united one is one sentence: the mind rests in the Self, and the longing has left. Osho says longing and resting cannot share a room — the moment you truly rest, the longing is gone, not by force but by fulfillment. You cannot kill desire by fighting it; you can only become so full inside that desire finds no vacancy. The mind resting in the Self is like a guest who has finally reached home after years of hotel-hopping. The united one is not the one who won a war with desire — he is the one who came home."]
